<%- include("partials/header", { title: "AI Ethics", pageTitle: "AI Ethics" }) %>

<section>
    <h2>Why Ethics Matters in AI</h2>
    <article>
        <h3>Why Ethics Is Important</h3>
        <p>
            AI systems can influence hiring, healthcare, loans, and policing, so mistakes can have real consequences.
            Ethical design focuses on fairness, transparency, privacy, and accountability.
        </p>
        <img src="/img/ai-ethics.jpg" alt="Scale symbol representing fairness and ethics in AI">
    </article>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Common Ethical Concerns</h2>
    <article>
        <h3>Main Concerns</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Bias:</strong> Models can reflect unfair patterns from training data.</li>
            <li><strong>Privacy:</strong> AI may collect or infer sensitive information.</li>
            <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> Some models are hard to explain as black-box systems.</li>
            <li><strong>Misuse:</strong> AI can be used for scams, deepfakes, or surveillance.</li>
        </ul>
    </article>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>How Developers Can Help</h2>
    <article>
        <h3>Developer Responsibility</h3>
        <p>
            Developers can reduce harm by testing for bias, limiting data collection, documenting
            model behavior, and making sure users understand what the system can and cannot do.
        </p>
    </article>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Source:</h2>
